<title>USA: Lubrizol expands stock repurchase program.</title>
<headline>Lubrizol expands stock repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lubrizol Corp said on Monday its board authorized a four million share expansion of the company's existing repurchase authorization.</p>
<p>In a program announced a year ago, the chemical supplier authorized the sale of four million shares. Roughly 1.7 million shares of that original authorization remain to be purchased, Lubrizol said.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
